### TSK-004B Contextual Page Guide Content Completion — Summary

#### Summary of Work Completed
1. **Replaced Generic Step Guidance**: Updated `app/Modules/Platform/Support/TutorialRegistry.php` across all 17 registered screens (`UI-SYS-001` through `UI-SYS-004`, `UI-ADM-002` through `UI-ADM-005`, `UI-ADM-010`–`UI-ADM-012`, `UI-CAT-001`–`UI-CAT-004`, `UI-CAT-006`, and `UI-CAT-007`). Every generic step (such as *"Perform the published action shown on this screen"*) was replaced with explicit, bilingual, step-by-step guidance grounded in PRD requirements, user flows, and actual screen views.
2. **Human-Readable Action Labels**: Mapped all 17 permission keys used across registered guides in `actionLabel()` to clear Arabic and English titles (e.g. `dashboard_reports.view` → *"عرض مؤشرات لوحة التحكم والتقارير / View dashboard indicators and reports"*), ensuring no raw permission key names or generic fallbacks are displayed.
3. **Bilingual User Flows**: Updated `app/Modules/Platform/Support/UserFlowRegistry.php` so all 13 user flows (`FLW-UI-01`, `FLW-HELP-01`, `FLW-HELP-02`, `FLW-CAT-01`, `FLW-CAT-02`, `FLW-ADM-01`–`FLW-ADM-05`, `FLW-SYS-01`–`FLW-SYS-03`) provide fully localized (`ar`/`en`) step text, actors, preconditions, triggers, alternate paths, failure paths, and audit expectations.
4. **Layout Alignment**: Updated `resources/views/platform/help/screen.blade.php` and `resources/views/platform/help/flow.blade.php` closing tags to `</x-layouts::app>`, fixing the structural bug where desktop full-guide content rendered below the sidebar.
5. **Alpine JS Rendering Protection**: Enhanced the `text(value)` helper in `resources/views/components/platform/dashboard-tools.blade.php` to handle string, object `{ar, en}`, and array text structures without nested `Array` or `[object Object]` text leakage. Added explicit DOM selector check in `startTour()` to safely skip tours when no target elements exist.
6. **Project Reconciliation**: Reconciled `.ai/TEST_RESULTS.md`, `.ai/CURRENT_TASK.md`, and `.ai/SESSION_SUMMARY.md`.

